longer a zero-price acquisition route for new users. Long simulation horizons need a fixed time budget and consistent simulation settings.","limitations","guidance","list","配置步骤","ordered",true,"items",[79,80,81],"setup","Download the free official-site release and install the open graphics, sound and music base sets.","Fix the map seed, game options, date and starting save; omit uncontrolled NewGRF additions.","Use a small scenario or local dedicated server and define a measurable transport objective.","可以尝试的任务",false,[86,87,88],"testTasks","Connect fixed industries and reach a target delivery or profit level within a fixed game period.","Repair a rail deadlock or pathfinding rule and replay the same saved game.","Verify save/load and synchronization after a source or script change.","AI 使用与评估条件","Open source and open base sets can support reproducible scenarios. Keep the base-set and NewGRF licenses separate, especially when exporting visual fixtures or distributing a benchmark bundle.","aiUseNote","links","参考依据",[96,97,98],"evidence",{"_58":103,"_25":104},{"_58":101,"_25":102},{"_58":99,"_25":100},"代码许可","https://github.com/OpenTTD/OpenTTD/blob/master/COPYING.md","March 2026 Steam distribution change","https://www.openttd.org/news/2026/03/14/steam-changes","Official source and build guidance","https://github.com/OpenTTD/OpenTTD","查看许可条款",[108],"licenseUrl",{"_58":105,"_25":100},"许可类别","代码与资产采用不同许可","terms","provenance","资产许可","Use the separate OpenGFX, OpenSFX and OpenMSX base sets and retain their licenses. Original Transport Tycoon Deluxe data is not an open asset pack.","assetLicense","GPLv2; component notices remain applicable.","codeLicense","开始使用",[121],"access",{"_58":122,"_25":123,"_124":125},"Free official download","https://www.openttd.org/downloads/openttd-releases/latest","note","The official-site build remains free. Since March 2026, new Steam/GOG users acquire it through a paid bundle with original TTD; existing users retain updates.","主要来源",[129],"